1
00:00:54,840 --> 00:00:55,600
You're not here

2
00:00:55,600 --> 00:00:56,600
to gloat, are you?

3
00:00:58,680 --> 00:00:59,600
I practically saved

4
00:00:59,600 --> 00:01:00,600
your life.

5
00:01:00,920 --> 00:01:02,380
Is that how you speak to me?

6
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:03,960
Saved my life?

7
00:01:09,320 --> 00:01:10,320
Focus the camera.

8
00:01:11,480 --> 00:01:12,880
Something's wrong with Xia Yimo.

9
00:01:12,880 --> 00:01:13,810
Is she drowning?

10
00:01:14,640 --> 00:01:15,080
No way.

11
00:01:15,440 --> 00:01:16,760
Isn't Ms. Xia a good swimmer?

12
00:01:16,760 --> 00:01:17,240
Exactly.

13
00:01:17,240 --> 00:01:17,640
No,

14
00:01:18,400 --> 00:01:19,000
save them!

15
00:01:19,480 --> 00:01:21,010
Wait, who knows how to dive?

16
00:01:21,320 --> 00:01:22,000
Hurry up!

17
00:01:22,280 --> 00:01:23,480
Who can do it? Hurry!

18
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:25,480
Help!

19
00:01:25,520 --> 00:01:25,920
Hurry!

20
00:01:31,200 --> 00:01:31,880
Been in a coma for days

21
00:01:31,880 --> 00:01:33,210
and remembers nothing.

22
00:01:33,840 --> 00:01:34,640
Still acting tough

23
00:01:34,640 --> 00:01:36,240
about your swimming skills.

24
00:01:42,160 --> 00:01:42,960
What's wrong?

25
00:01:46,560 --> 00:01:48,039
When I was in a coma,

26
00:01:48,120 --> 00:01:49,979
I felt like I had a very long dream.

27
00:01:50,400 --> 00:01:51,130
In the dream,

28
00:01:51,800 --> 00:01:53,400
I played many roles.

29
00:01:54,640 --> 00:01:55,160
To save

30
00:01:55,160 --> 00:01:56,960
Xue Ruowan, the role you played,

31
00:01:58,039 --> 00:01:59,600
I died over and over again.

32
00:02:01,760 --> 00:02:02,560
I thought

33
00:02:03,080 --> 00:02:05,410
you would stab me
a few times in your dream.

34
00:02:06,520 --> 00:02:08,240
I'm not that dark inside.

35
00:02:10,199 --> 00:02:11,400
About me accidentally
hurting you with a prop

36
00:02:11,400 --> 00:02:12,920
during last year's audition,

37
00:02:12,920 --> 00:02:14,680
and getting that role in the end,

38
00:02:14,680 --> 00:02:15,920
have you always thought

39
00:02:15,920 --> 00:02:16,980
I did it on purpose?

40
00:02:19,280 --> 00:02:20,520
I know

41
00:02:21,560 --> 00:02:23,360
you didn't tamper with the prop.

42
00:02:25,200 --> 00:02:25,800
Director,

43
00:02:26,800 --> 00:02:27,880
I told you about this before.

44
00:02:27,880 --> 00:02:28,720
Ms. Xiaofei,

45
00:02:28,920 --> 00:02:30,160
Her acting is really good.

46
00:02:30,160 --> 00:02:31,160
Hello, Director.

47
00:02:31,400 --> 00:02:31,800
Hello.

48
00:02:32,400 --> 00:02:33,640
You're just in time.

49
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:35,730
Can you two do a scene together?

50
00:02:35,920 --> 00:02:37,850
Ms. Xia will play the older sister,

51
00:02:37,960 --> 00:02:39,690
and Ms. Sun the younger sister.

52
00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:45,520
I don't want to fight with you.

53
00:02:45,520 --> 00:02:47,160
I just want to live my life.

54
00:02:51,000 --> 00:02:51,720
Anyway...

55
00:02:52,200 --> 00:02:53,600
If you dare take a step today,

56
00:02:53,600 --> 00:02:54,400
I'll kill you.

57
00:03:01,240 --> 00:03:01,640
Momo,

58
00:03:02,680 --> 00:03:04,010
Who prepared the props?

59
00:03:04,240 --> 00:03:05,100
Where are they?

60
00:03:05,160 --> 00:03:06,960
I terminated my contract back then

61
00:03:06,960 --> 00:03:08,160
because everyone gave

62
00:03:08,160 --> 00:03:09,280
all the resources to you

63
00:03:09,280 --> 00:03:10,610
and treated me as a foil.

64
00:03:10,960 --> 00:03:11,600
I was just a nobody

65
00:03:11,600 --> 00:03:12,930
that no one cared about.

66
00:03:13,240 --> 00:03:13,880
Even though I know

67
00:03:13,880 --> 00:03:15,410
you've always helped me...

68
00:03:15,480 --> 00:03:16,880
But in my eyes at the time,

69
00:03:16,960 --> 00:03:18,040
it was just charity.

70
00:03:18,040 --> 00:03:19,120
I never treated you

71
00:03:19,160 --> 00:03:20,160
as my foil.

72
00:03:20,960 --> 00:03:21,880
I did all this

73
00:03:22,240 --> 00:03:24,170
just so you wouldn't end up like me,

74
00:03:25,400 --> 00:03:26,660
after getting famous,

75
00:03:26,840 --> 00:03:28,300
losing the right to choose

76
00:03:28,760 --> 00:03:30,420
and taking repetitive roles.

77
00:03:31,280 --> 00:03:32,000
That's why I kept fighting

78
00:03:32,000 --> 00:03:33,520
for those roles for you,

79
00:03:35,400 --> 00:03:37,000
but I ignored your feelings.

80
00:03:37,840 --> 00:03:38,700
It was my fault.

81
00:03:40,200 --> 00:03:41,329
It's all in the past.

82
00:03:41,720 --> 00:03:42,320
So,

83
00:03:42,880 --> 00:03:44,079
are we still friends?

84
00:03:47,880 --> 00:03:48,480
Of course.

85
00:03:50,079 --> 00:03:50,740
However...

86
00:03:51,200 --> 00:03:52,660
I saw people online saying

87
00:03:53,040 --> 00:03:54,400
I played the victim

88
00:03:54,600 --> 00:03:56,200
to smear you for top billing.

89
00:03:57,280 --> 00:03:59,480
Now you're definitely the female lead.

90
00:04:00,200 --> 00:04:01,680
The director cast you as Xue Keying

91
00:04:01,680 --> 00:04:04,000
because he truly thinks you're a good fit.

92
00:04:04,000 --> 00:04:04,720
If you care so much

93
00:04:04,720 --> 00:04:06,120
about this leading role,

94
00:04:06,200 --> 00:04:07,480
let's compete fairly.

95
00:04:10,880 --> 00:04:12,010
I've already heard.

96
00:04:12,760 --> 00:04:14,880
The director found an actor to replace me.

97
00:04:14,880 --> 00:04:15,960
Now, whether it's the female lead

98
00:04:15,960 --> 00:04:17,160
or the second female lead,

99
00:04:17,160 --> 00:04:19,040
it has nothing to do with me anymore.

100
00:04:19,040 --> 00:04:20,100
Giving up already?

101
00:04:21,040 --> 00:04:21,640
That doesn't sound like

102
00:04:21,640 --> 00:04:22,700
the Xia Yimo I know.

103
00:04:26,320 --> 00:04:26,850
Alright.

104
00:04:27,560 --> 00:04:28,600
I'll get going then.

105
00:04:28,600 --> 00:04:29,660
Get some good rest.

106
00:04:32,600 --> 00:04:33,930
Thank you for saving me.

107
00:04:37,720 --> 00:04:38,240
I didn't come here

108
00:04:38,240 --> 00:04:39,680
to hear you say thank you.

109
00:04:41,040 --> 00:04:42,400
Do you remember

110
00:04:42,680 --> 00:04:43,600
what we said in college?

111
00:04:43,600 --> 00:04:44,320
If we ever

112
00:04:44,400 --> 00:04:45,530
got a little famous,

113
00:04:45,680 --> 00:04:47,210
we'd act in a show together?

114
00:04:58,840 --> 00:04:59,840
Why?

115
00:05:03,160 --> 00:05:04,690
Why should my life and death

116
00:05:05,120 --> 00:05:06,880
be decided by Xia Yimo?

117
00:05:12,400 --> 00:05:13,560
I truly lived once

118
00:05:13,680 --> 00:05:15,680
in the world of Moxiang.

119
00:05:17,160 --> 00:05:18,080
The marks I left

120
00:05:18,160 --> 00:05:19,080
in this world,

121
00:05:19,200 --> 00:05:21,120
they should all belong to me,

122
00:05:21,600 --> 00:05:23,000
not Xia Yimo.

123
00:05:23,440 --> 00:05:24,700
Fictional characters

124
00:05:24,840 --> 00:05:26,800
are just illusions.

125
00:05:27,200 --> 00:05:29,120
No matter how well you act,

126
00:05:29,400 --> 00:05:30,680
you're still just a character.

127
00:05:30,680 --> 00:05:31,880
A fleeting dream.

128
00:05:32,159 --> 00:05:32,880
No.

129
00:05:34,880 --> 00:05:36,040
Every character

130
00:05:36,960 --> 00:05:38,760
has their own independent life.

131
00:05:48,040 --> 00:05:51,080
Now that I, Xue Keying, have been created,

132
00:05:52,000 --> 00:05:53,930
don't even think about erasing me.

133
00:05:59,920 --> 00:06:00,520
I want to go

134
00:06:02,080 --> 00:06:03,240
here.

135
00:06:04,080 --> 00:06:04,720
I'll go.

136
00:06:10,800 --> 00:06:11,200
Hello?

137
00:06:11,520 --> 00:06:11,920
Momo,

138
00:06:12,320 --> 00:06:13,320
the public backlash is so huge.

139
00:06:13,320 --> 00:06:14,520
The company and the producers of Moxiang

140
00:06:14,520 --> 00:06:15,720
are about to fall out.

141
00:06:15,880 --> 00:06:16,920
The boss said

142
00:06:16,920 --> 00:06:18,960
you need to join
the next crew immediately.

143
00:06:18,960 --> 00:06:20,400
Hello, Momo.

144
00:06:20,720 --> 00:06:21,680
Can you hear me?

145
00:06:21,960 --> 00:06:22,440
Okay,

146
00:06:23,600 --> 00:06:24,200
I got it.

147
00:06:24,480 --> 00:06:24,920
Good.

148
00:06:48,200 --> 00:06:49,120
Xia Yimo,

149
00:06:49,640 --> 00:06:50,640
have you forgotten your

150
00:06:50,640 --> 00:06:51,720
bold words?

151
00:06:52,159 --> 00:06:53,120
You said you wanted to find

152
00:06:53,120 --> 00:06:54,320
your original passion for acting,

153
00:06:54,320 --> 00:06:56,240
to fully immerse yourself in a role

154
00:06:56,240 --> 00:06:57,560
and live for it once.

155
00:07:00,920 --> 00:07:01,680
But...

156
00:07:03,480 --> 00:07:05,680
They say I can't even play you well.

157
00:07:06,960 --> 00:07:08,480
Once I play the second female lead,

158
00:07:08,480 --> 00:07:10,440
I'll be labeled as a villainess.

159
00:07:10,720 --> 00:07:12,280
What's there to be afraid of?

160
00:07:12,280 --> 00:07:12,960
Do you think

161
00:07:13,000 --> 00:07:13,930
you lack labels?

162
00:07:14,440 --> 00:07:14,880
I...

163
00:07:15,080 --> 00:07:16,610
You should live arrogantly

164
00:07:16,840 --> 00:07:17,770
and beautifully

165
00:07:17,920 --> 00:07:18,720
like me.

166
00:07:20,200 --> 00:07:21,200
Show that spirit.

167
00:07:22,160 --> 00:07:23,560
I won't allow you to fail.

168
00:07:32,560 --> 00:07:34,090
Sun Xiaofei, are you crazy?

169
00:07:34,280 --> 00:07:35,080
I finally managed

170
00:07:35,080 --> 00:07:36,240
to kick Xia Yimo out,

171
00:07:37,040 --> 00:07:38,320
and now you're the female lead.

172
00:07:38,320 --> 00:07:40,040
Why are you fighting for a role for her?

173
00:07:40,040 --> 00:07:41,480
I remember warning you

174
00:07:42,000 --> 00:07:43,080
not to pull these dirty tricks

175
00:07:43,080 --> 00:07:44,440
behind my back.

176
00:07:44,920 --> 00:07:45,520
Don't think

177
00:07:45,520 --> 00:07:47,320
I don't know what you did before.

178
00:07:47,320 --> 00:07:48,600
Xia Yimo is my friend.

179
00:07:49,200 --> 00:07:50,200
I don't want this.

180
00:07:50,880 --> 00:07:52,540
There's only one female lead.

181
00:07:52,560 --> 00:07:54,080
If you don't fight, she'll replace you.

182
00:07:54,080 --> 00:07:54,840
Do you think Xia Yimo

183
00:07:54,840 --> 00:07:56,120
is willing to be your supporting actress?

184
00:07:56,120 --> 00:07:57,520
Who says I'm not willing?

185
00:07:58,680 --> 00:08:00,400
Even if I can't play Xue Keying,

186
00:08:00,400 --> 00:08:02,330
any other supporting role is fine.

187
00:08:02,640 --> 00:08:03,080
I think

188
00:08:03,120 --> 00:08:04,640
the role of Xiaolan is pretty good.

189
00:08:04,640 --> 00:08:05,370
I can play it.

190
00:08:05,880 --> 00:08:07,040
Didn't you buy

191
00:08:07,720 --> 00:08:08,800
online articles to smear me

192
00:08:08,800 --> 00:08:09,730
as a drama queen?

193
00:08:10,280 --> 00:08:11,320
I'll show you

194
00:08:11,760 --> 00:08:13,800
what a real drama queen is.

195
00:08:14,600 --> 00:08:15,000
You...

196
00:08:15,120 --> 00:08:16,200
Don't be afraid.

197
00:08:16,400 --> 00:08:17,400
It's a prop.

198
00:08:17,640 --> 00:08:18,320
It's fake.

199
00:08:25,400 --> 00:08:26,320
Have you memorized your lines?

200
00:08:26,320 --> 00:08:26,920
Of course.

201
00:08:26,920 --> 00:08:27,920
It's very simple.

202
00:08:28,400 --> 00:08:29,040
Hello, Ms. Xia.

203
00:08:29,040 --> 00:08:29,900
Hello, Ms. Sun.

204
00:08:29,960 --> 00:08:31,090
I'm actor Xiao Chen.

205
00:08:33,039 --> 00:08:33,700
Who is this?

206
00:08:36,159 --> 00:08:37,360
The second male lead.

207
00:08:37,440 --> 00:08:38,679
He even saved you.

208
00:08:39,400 --> 00:08:41,200
Weren't you the one who saved me?

209
00:08:55,920 --> 00:08:57,160
Give me a hand.

210
00:08:57,200 --> 00:08:58,800
It's my honor to save Ms. Xia.

211
00:08:58,960 --> 00:08:59,960
I'm also your fan.

212
00:09:01,000 --> 00:09:02,560
Instead of flattering me,

213
00:09:02,800 --> 00:09:03,760
you should focus more

214
00:09:03,760 --> 00:09:04,480
on acting.

215
00:09:05,440 --> 00:09:05,970
Let's go.

216
00:09:08,240 --> 00:09:08,700
Ms. Xia,

217
00:09:09,280 --> 00:09:11,410
are you still going to act in this play?

218
00:09:13,280 --> 00:09:14,010
Don't worry.

219
00:09:14,320 --> 00:09:16,450
Excellent creators will always meet.

220
00:09:18,240 --> 00:09:18,770
Let's go.

221
00:09:30,520 --> 00:09:32,450
Look, the weather is so nice today.

222
00:09:32,600 --> 00:09:34,240
We have distinguished guests today.

223
00:09:34,240 --> 00:09:36,160
If people see you like this,

224
00:09:36,840 --> 00:09:37,520
wouldn't it disgrace

225
00:09:37,520 --> 00:09:38,640
our Duke's Residence?

226
00:09:38,640 --> 00:09:39,300
Yesterday,

227
00:09:39,480 --> 00:09:40,760
your precious daughter

228
00:09:40,760 --> 00:09:41,890
misread the couplet

229
00:09:42,280 --> 00:09:43,480
written by Her Majesty

230
00:09:43,480 --> 00:09:44,680
at the spring banquet.

231
00:09:44,680 --> 00:09:45,680
Why didn't you say

232
00:09:46,080 --> 00:09:48,140
she disgraced the Duke's Residence?

233
00:09:48,360 --> 00:09:49,120
You loser,

234
00:09:49,880 --> 00:09:51,740
how dare you laugh at my daughter?

235
00:09:51,920 --> 00:09:53,980
See how I'll teach you a lesson today.

236
00:10:00,520 --> 00:10:01,240
My dear,

237
00:10:01,480 --> 00:10:02,940
why are you sleeping here?

238
00:10:04,360 --> 00:10:04,890
Ying'er!

239
00:10:06,480 --> 00:10:07,040
Wake up.

240
00:10:12,520 --> 00:10:12,980
Mother.

241
00:10:14,120 --> 00:10:15,200
Come, get up.

242
00:10:15,520 --> 00:10:16,160
Slowly.

243
00:10:16,480 --> 00:10:16,880
Come.

244
00:10:22,600 --> 00:10:24,080
Where are we?

245
00:10:25,600 --> 00:10:27,130
Are you still half-asleep?

246
00:10:27,200 --> 00:10:28,640
This is our home.

247
00:10:31,280 --> 00:10:31,880
By the way,

248
00:10:32,000 --> 00:10:33,400
an honored guest is coming today.

249
00:10:33,400 --> 00:10:35,060
Let Mother help you get ready.

250
00:10:35,560 --> 00:10:36,090
Let's go.

251
00:10:36,920 --> 00:10:37,600
Hurry up.

252
00:10:37,680 --> 00:10:39,280
My Lady, let's go quickly.

253
00:10:52,880 --> 00:10:53,880
Am I...

254
00:10:54,480 --> 00:10:55,440
Am I...

255
00:10:56,280 --> 00:10:57,320
back again?

256
00:11:07,360 --> 00:11:08,240
Ning Yuanci!

257
00:11:10,000 --> 00:11:10,680
Who are you?

258
00:11:11,080 --> 00:11:12,940
How dare you address me by my name?

259
00:11:15,280 --> 00:11:16,160
I...
